{
  "_comment": [
    "Reviewable registry of the Nitnem / Gutka banis shipped by the app.",
    "Titles and descriptions here are this project's own words.",
    "shabados_bani_id points at the `banis` table of the ShabadOS open database",
    "(github.com/shabados/database, release 4.8.7). It is used for WHICH lines belong",
    "to a bani and in what groups; every Sri Guru Granth Sahib Ji line is then resolved",
    "to OUR verbatim `lines.id` and rendered from our corpus. Only Sri Dasam Granth /",
    "Ardaas text is taken from ShabadOS (converted, unfolded) into `extra_lines`.",
    "Editorial choices are explicit fields, never inherited silently:",
    "  prepend_line_ranges — SGGS line-id ranges read BEFORE the ShabadOS set (e.g. the",
    "  ਗੁਰਦੇਵ ਮਾਤਾ salok that gutkas print before Sukhmani Sahib).",
    "  append_line_ranges — SGGS line-id ranges read AFTER the ShabadOS set.",
    "Estimated minutes are typical unhurried reading times, for planning only."
  ],
